      "id": 3427626,
      "postDate": "2026-03-24T10:06:54.490Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "Directly use the zero-shot prompting method to test the performance of mainstream LLMs. The prompt used for the request is consistent with the official testing method:\n```\nprompt + '\\nPlease put your final answer inside `\\\\boxed{}`. For example: `\\\\boxed{your answer}`'\n```\n\nThe test results are as follows:\n\n| model | think | max_tokens | score |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Gemini-3.1-Pro | ✅ | 32768 | **0.81** |\n| Claude-Opus-4.6 | ✅ | 32768 | **0.78** |\n| DeepSeek-V3.2   | ✅ | 32768 | **0.74** |\n| Kimi-K2.5 | ✅ | 32768 | 0.72 |\n| Qwen3-Max | ✅ | 32768 | 0.72 |\n| MiniMax-M2.5 | ✅ | 32768 | 0.66 |\n| Qwen3.5-Plus | ✅ | 32768 | 0.64 |\n| GLM-5 | ✅ | 32768 | 0.52 | 0.52 |\n| Claude-Sonnet-4.5 | ❌ | 32768 | 0.51 |\n| GPT-5.4 | ❌ | 32768 | 0.36 |\n\n\nFor the complete comparison, see here：https://www.kaggle.com/code/jiazhuang/nemotron-mainstream-llm-performance-comparison",
      "content": "<p>Directly use the zero-shot prompting method to test the performance of mainstream LLMs. The prompt used for the request is consistent with the official testing method:</p>\n<pre><code>prompt + '\\nPlease put your final answer inside `\\\\boxed{}`. For example: `\\\\boxed{your answer}`'\n</code></pre>\n<p>The test results are as follows:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>model</th>\n<th>think</th>\n<th>max_tokens</th>\n<th>score</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Gemini-3.1-Pro</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td><strong>0.81</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude-Opus-4.6</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td><strong>0.78</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSeek-V3.2</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td><strong>0.74</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kimi-K2.5</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>0.72</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qwen3-Max</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>0.72</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MiniMax-M2.5</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>0.66</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qwen3.5-Plus</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>0.64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GLM-5</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>0.52</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude-Sonnet-4.5</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>0.51</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT-5.4</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>0.36</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>For the complete comparison, see here：<a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/jiazhuang/nemotron-mainstream-llm-performance-comparison\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kaggle.com/code/jiazhuang/nemotron-mainstream-llm-performance-comparison</a></p>",
